  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">這是一個簡單的天空島世界，你將從有限的資源出發，必須透過建造農場和開墾更多土地來逐步發展。所以拿出你的鎬子，開始挖掘吧！<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_323ecb84-f429-4bf7-b712-2af80090bb40.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"825\" height=\"594\"></span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp;玩得開心 :)</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>試試看我的其他地圖！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/forest-and-fields-adventure-map\" rel=\"nofollow\">森林與田野</a><br></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/the-mysterious-island\" rel=\"nofollow\">神秘島</a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/seven-survival-islands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">七大生存島</a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>J.M.J</strong></span></p>",
